{
  "commit": {"author":"Timo Sulg <timgluz@gmail.com>","changes":[{"change_type":"modified","content_hash":"bfab1d1f79479cc970c673bc84bc7e62219ea790e9a7c4e0ae1fc8141e335ab4","doc_type":"context","document_id":"019e2683-38ae-7bc2-8884-87a795ed4eef","hunks":[{"context":"## Current Focus","lines":[{"content":"vitest + **Playwright** (`.pw-browsers` chromium) + `ocr` review — see [[notes/agent-dev-notes]]","op":"context"},{"content":"for the environment gotchas before starting.","op":"context"},{"content":"","op":"context"},{"content":"## Incoming focus: solver benchmarking (2026-10-12)","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"**Next major effort — planned and specced, nothing implemented yet.**","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"Spec: `decisions/benchmarking-design`. Implementation plan (untracked, by design):","op":"add"},{"content":"`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-12-benchmark-all-algorithms.md`.","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"Goal: measure every solver on a capability-tiered instance set, publish versioned JSON, and","op":"add"},{"content":"render per-algorithm results on each algorithm page. Re-run differentially per release, keeping","op":"add"},{"content":"old versions for regression checking.","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"Nine tasks created, split from the plan:","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"| Task | Depends on |","op":"add"},{"content":"|---|---|","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-sa-honours-epoch-budget` | — |","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-platoo-epochs-help-name` | sa-budget |","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-plateau-stop-all-iterative` | sa-budget |","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-measurement-harness` | all three above |","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-tier-a-campaign` | harness |","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-publish-provenance` | campaign |","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-algorithm-pages` | publish |","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-docs-spec-update` | publish |","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-single-solver-skill` | publish |","op":"add"},{"content":"| `tasks/bench-regression-history` | publish (optional, may stay unstarted) |","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"Three things worth remembering when picking this up:","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"1. **Per-solver provenance is correctness-critical and must land before the first differential","op":"add"},{"content":"   publish.** `algorithms/{id}.json` currently assumes one commit for the whole dataset, which","op":"add"},{"content":"   becomes a false claim once only some algorithms are re-measured — and unlike a wrong number it","op":"add"},{"content":"   cannot be reconstructed after publication.","op":"add"},{"content":"2. **\"Convergence\" is not yet measurable.** Only `lin_kernighan` and `stochastic_hill` have a","op":"add"},{"content":"   plateau stop, and `sa` ignores `--epochs` entirely (flat runtime at 10 vs 10000 epochs), so the","op":"add"},{"content":"   three prerequisite fixes gate everything downstream.","op":"add"},{"content":"3. **`si175` cannot be parsed** (`UPPER_DIAG_ROW` unsupported) — substitute rather than skip","op":"add"},{"content":"   silently when building the tier set.","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"Related pre-existing gap: `gen-problem-pages.mjs` reads only the COMMENT line, so several problem","op":"add"},{"content":"pages show `optimalCost: null` despite a full `.opt.tour` being present.","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"","op":"add"},{"content":"## Recent merges (master, 2026-08-16 session)","op":"context"},{"content":"","op":"context"},{"content":"| Commit | PR | Change |","op":"context"}],"new_count":48,"new_start":17,"old_count":6,"old_start":17}],"new_version":14,"previous_commit_id":"01a00bef-815a-7380-980e-3d9eaa104b5f","previous_hash":"d3f1d0aefd5fed9ab21dd6769ba8c38e7c38632af2d4cc0e698516dcdd434538","pr